OL,3,AMan charged with attack on Australian
OL,4,AMP as suspect's father says she is
OL,5,Afamily friend
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 43-year-old man has been charged
OL,8,Fafter Australian MP Helen Haines was
OL,9,Fhit by a car in the state of Victoria
OL,10,Fon Monday.
OL,12,FThe suspect will appear in court on
OL,13,FWednesday to face charges of dangerous
OL,14,Fdriving causing serious injury,
OL,15,Fintentionally causing serious injury
OL,16,Fand the federal offence of causing harm
OL,17,Fto a public official.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
